column13:
Type of TB preventive therapy used.

Source-form regimen types include:
INH = Isoniazid;
3HP = Rifapentine and Isoniazid;
CTX/INH/B6 FDC = Cotrimoxazole/Isoniazid/Pyridoxine fixed-dose combination.

Final outcome for a contact started on TB preventive therapy.

Source categories are:
Treatment completed;
Loss to follow-up;
Died;
Developed active TB;
Not evaluated.
